    "macro_cross_check":  "Source band 452 cal / 16.18 carbs / 67.45 g protein per serving over 4. My build: 170 g raw breast per serving (204 cal, 38 g P), balsamic 24 g (21 cal), olive oil 6.75 g (59 cal), butter 3.5 g (25 cal), honey 15.75 g (48 cal) = about 358 cal, 39 g protein, 17 g carbs. Carbs match. PROTEIN IS 42% UNDER, but the published figure is arithmetically impossible: 1.5 lb of raw breast holds ~153 g protein total, so 4 servings cannot exceed ~38 g each. I trust the grams and read the band as wrong. TWO LOUD FLAGS: (1) at 358 cal per serving this recipe falls BELOW the run\u0027s 400 cal floor on its own ingredient list, and (2) if the band figure was what qualified it, the qualification was based on a bad number."
